GET / -> 200 root
GET /api/books -> 200 list
GET /api/books/7 -> 200 book 7
GET /api/books/7/pages/3 -> 200 book 7 page 3
GET /version -> 200 v1
GET /api/authors/ann -> 200 author ann
GET /files/a/b.txt -> 200 file a/b.txt
GET /api/books/ -> 200 list
PUT -> 200 PUT book 2
PATCH -> 200 PATCH book 2
DELETE -> 200 deleted 2
HEAD -> 200 list
POST -> 405 GET, PUT, PATCH, DELETE application/problem+json
{"type":"about:blank","title":"Method Not Allowed","status":405,"instance":"/api/books/2"}
GET /nowhere -> 404 {"type":"about:blank","title":"Not Found","status":404,"instance":"/nowhere"}
GET /api/books BooksController.List Books
GET /api/books/{id} BooksController.Get Books
PUT /api/books/{id} BooksController.Update Books
PATCH /api/books/{id} BooksController.Update Books
GET /version BooksController.Version Books
GET /api/books/{id}/pages/{page} BooksController.Page Books
GET /api/authors/{name} AuthorsController.Get Authors
